# Shared session

Before acting, read `H:\Astro Pigeon\agent\SESSION.md`, `DECISIONS.md`, and `MAP.md`.

This repo's own rules still apply. Write a new standing decision into `DECISIONS.md` and, when it is ZAP-only, into `.cursor/rules` here. Do not start a second decisions log.
